      "dcterms:abstract": "We show a connection formula between two diﬀerent q-Airy func- tions. One is called the Ramanujan function which appears in Ra- manujan’s ”Lost notebook”. Another one is called the q-Airy function that obtained in the study of the second q-Painlev´e equation. We use the q-Borel transformation and the q-Laplace transformation following C. Zhang to obtain the connection formula.",
